<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Loyalty program dashboard · Card Avantaj</title>
<link rel="icon" href="../Guidelines/assets/logo/card-avantaj-symbol-color.png">
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/Chart.js/4.4.1/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/chartjs-plugin-datalabels/2.2.0/chartjs-plugin-datalabels.mi…
<style>

  @font-face{

    font-family:"Geologica";

    src:url("../Guidelines/assets/fonts/Geologica-Variable.ttf") format("truetype-variations");

    font-weight:100 900;

    font-display:swap;

  }

  :root{

    --red:#F21D2F; --red-alt:#F23E2E; --orange-red:#F25D27; --orange:#F2811D; --peach:#F2BC8D;

    --bg:oklch(0.97 0.008 42); --surface:oklch(0.995 0.003 42); --subtle:oklch(0.93 0.012 42);

    --border:oklch(0.89 0.016 42); --border-med:oklch(0.82 0.022 42);

    --ink:oklch(0.17 0.016 42); --ink-2:oklch(0.38 0.016 42); --ink-muted:oklch(0.56 0.010 42);

    --header-bg:oklch(0.13 0.022 38); --header-text:oklch(0.98 0.003 42); --header-muted:oklch(0.68 0.012 38);

    --green:oklch(0.40 0.12 148); --green-bg:oklch(0.95 0.05 148 / 0.50); --red-bg:oklch(0.97 0.05 25 / 0.50);

    --chart-muted:#7a6860; --chart-grid:rgba(160,110,90,0.09);

    --gradient-ember:linear-gradient(135deg,#F21D2F 0%,#F25D27 52%,#F2811D 100%);

    --pending-bg:rgba(242,129,29,.20); --pending-border:rgba(242,129,29,.55); --pending-ink:#7A4A0E;

    --radius:8px;

    --shadow:0 1px 3px oklch(0.13 0.022 38 / 0.06), 0 6px 20px oklch(0.13 0.022 38 / 0.04);

  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box;}

  body{

    margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);

    font-family:"Geologica",Arial,"Segoe UI",system-ui,sans-serif;

    font-variation-settings:"CRSV" 0;

  }

  h1,h2,.serif{font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;}

  .tabular{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}
 
  header.topbar{

    background:var(--header-bg);color:var(--header-text);height:64px;padding:0 28px;display:flex;align-items:center;

    justify-content:space-between;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:60;

  }

  header.topbar::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;height:3px;background:var(--gradient-ember);}

  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;}

  .brand img{height:32px;width:auto;display:block;}

  .brand .name{font-weight:600;font-size:15px;}

  .brand .sub{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--header-muted);font-weight:500;}

  .topbar-right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;}

  .last-available{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--header-muted);}

  .last-available strong{color:var(--header-text);font-weight:600;}

  .preview-badge{

    background:rgba(255,255,255,.10);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);color:var(--peach);

    font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:999px;letter-spacing:.02em;

  }
 
  .app-body{display:flex;max-width:1520px;margin:0 auto;}
 
  nav.sidebar{

    width:210px;flex:0 0 auto;padding:24px 14px;position:sticky;top:64px;

    height:calc(100vh - 64px);overflow-y:auto;border-right:1px solid var(--border);

  }

  nav.sidebar .navgroup-label{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;margin:16px 8px 6px;}

  nav.sidebar .navgroup-label:first-child{margin-top:2px;}

  nav.sidebar button.navlink{

    display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;background:none;border:none;font-family:inherit;

    font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);padding:9px 10px;border-radius:7px;cursor:pointer;margin-bottom:2px;

  }

  nav.sidebar button.navlink:hover{background:var(--subtle);color:var(--ink);}

  nav.sidebar button.navlink.active{background:var(--red);color:var(--surface);}
 
  main{flex:1 1 auto;padding:26px 32px 80px;min-width:0;}
 
  .filters-row{

    display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);

    border-radius:var(--radius);padding:10px 16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);position:sticky;top:64px;z-index:40;margin-bottom:22px;

  }

  .filter-block label{display:block;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;margin-bottom:3px;}

  .filter-block select{font-family:inherit;font-size:12.5px;padding:6px 9px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);width:150px;transition:border-color .15s,background .15s,color .15s;}

  .filter-block select.filter-active{border-color:var(--orange);background:var(--pending-bg);color:var(--pending-ink);font-weight:700;}

  .filter-sep{width:1px;align-self:stretch;background:var(--border);margin:0 2px;}

  .preset-row{display:flex;gap:6px;}

  .preset-btn{font-family:inherit;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink-2);cursor:pointer;}

  .preset-btn.active{background:var(--red);color:var(--surface);border-color:var(--red);}
 
  .tabpage{display:none;}

  .tabpage.active{display:block;}
 
  .tab-eyebrow{font-size:.67rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--red);margin:0 0 8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}
 
  .section-title{

    font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(1.15rem,1.7vw,1.4rem);

    color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin:32px 0 16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;

  }

  .section-title::after{content:"";flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--border);}

  .section-title:first-of-type{margin-top:0;}

  .section-sub{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-muted);margin:-10px 0 16px;font-weight:500;}
 
  .kpi-grid{

    display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:2px;background:var(--border);

    border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow);

  }

  .kpi-grid.cols-3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);}

  .kpi-grid.cols-2{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}

  .kpi-grid.cols-6{grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);}

  .kpi-card{background:var(--bg);padding:18px 20px;}

  .kpi-card .label{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-muted);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;}

  .kpi-card .value{font-size:1.7rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--orange-red);margin-top:6px;}

  .kpi-card .foot{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-muted);margin-top:5px;}

  .kpi-card .foot.up{color:var(--green);} .kpi-card .foot.down{color:var(--red);}

  .kpi-card.good .value{color:var(--green);}

  .kpi-card.warn .value{color:var(--orange);}

  .kpi-card.neutral .value{color:var(--ink);}

  .kpi-card.pending{background:var(--pending-bg);}

  .kpi-card.pending .value{color:var(--pending-ink);font-size:1.1rem;}
 
  .kpi-hero-row{margin-top:14px;}

  .kpi-hero-card{

    background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);

    padding:16px 22px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;

  }

  .kpi-hero-card .hero-label{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;min-width:190px;}

  .kpi-hero-card .hero-value{font-size:1.9rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--orange-red);}

  .kpi-hero-card .hero-foot{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-muted);margin-left:auto;}
 
  .charts-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;}

  .chart-card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:18px 20px 10px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);}

  .chart-card.full{grid-column:1/-1;}

  .chart-card.pending{background:var(--pending-bg);border-color:var(--pending-border);}

  .chart-card h3{margin:0 0 2px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;}

  .chart-card .desc{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-muted);margin:0 0 10px;}

  .chart-wrap{height:260px;position:relative;}

  .chart-wrap.tall{height:340px;}

  .chart-wrap.xtall{height:460px;}
 
  .legend-key{display:flex;gap:16px;margin:0 0 10px;flex-wrap:wrap;}

  .legend-key .item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);}

  .legend-key .dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:3px;display:inline-block;}
 
  table.datatable{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12.5px;}

  table.datatable th{text-align:left;font-size:10.5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink-2);background:var(--subtle);border-bottom:2px solid var(--border);padding:7px 8px;}

  table.datatable td{padding:7px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--ink);}

  table.datatable tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none;}

  table.datatable tr.total-row td{font-weight:700;}

  table.datatable td.num, table.datatable th.num{text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}

  table.datatable td.term{font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;width:1%;}

  table.datatable td.groupsep{border-left:2px solid var(--border-med);}

  table.datatable th.groupsep{border-left:2px solid var(--border-med);}
 
  table.datatable th.sortable{cursor:pointer;user-select:none;white-space:nowrap;}

  table.datatable th.sortable:hover{color:var(--ink);}

  table.datatable th.sortable .arrow{display:inline-block;width:9px;font-size:9px;color:var(--red);}
 
  .table-scroll{max-height:360px;overflow-y:auto;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;}

  .table-scroll table.datatable{margin:0;}

  .table-scroll thead th{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1;}

  .scroll-hint{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink-muted);margin:6px 2px 0;}
 
  .level-chip{display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;}

  .level-chip.l2{background:var(--red-alt);}

  .level-chip.l3{background:var(--red);}
 
  .note-banner{background:var(--subtle);border:1px solid var(--border-med);color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:18px;}

  .note-banner.future{background:transparent;border:1px dashed var(--border-med);color:var(--ink-muted);}

  .note-banner.flag{background:var(--pending-bg);border-color:var(--pending-border);color:var(--pending-ink);}
 
  .data-pending{

    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:var(--pending-ink);

    background:var(--pending-bg);border:1px solid var(--pending-border);padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;

    letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap;

  }

  .data-pending::before{content:"●";font-size:8px;color:var(--orange);}
 
  .selector-row{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;}

  .selector-row label{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;}

  .selector-row select{font-family:inherit;font-size:12.5px;padding:5px 9px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);}
 
  .period-group{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-end;background:var(--subtle);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;}

  .period-group .tag{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink-muted);align-self:center;margin-right:2px;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
 
<header class="topbar">
<div class="brand">
<img src="../Guidelines/assets/logo/card-avantaj-symbol-color.png" alt="Card Avantaj">
<div>
<div class="name">Loyalty program</div>
<div class="sub">Card Avantaj</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="topbar-right">
<div class="last-available">Last available date: <strong>28 Jul 2026</strong></div>
<div class="preview-badge">Preview · mock data</div>
</div>
</header>
 
<div class="app-body">
<nav class="sidebar">
<div class="navgroup-label">Overview</div>
<button class="navlink active" data-tab="exec">Executive summary</button>
<button class="navlink" data-tab="financial">Financial impact</button>
<div class="navgroup-label">Engagement</div>
<button class="navlink" data-tab="coins">Coins &amp; redemption</button>
<button class="navlink" data-tab="challenges">Challenges</button>
<button class="navlink" data-tab="badges">Badges</button>
<button class="navlink" data-tab="trends">Trends</button>
<button class="navlink" data-tab="periodcompare">Period comparison</button>
<div class="navgroup-label">Structure</div>
<button class="navlink" data-tab="tiers">Tier progression</button>
<button class="navlink" data-tab="wizz">Wizz reconciliation</button>
<div class="navgroup-label">Reference</div>
<button class="navlink" data-tab="glossary">Glossary</button>
</nav>
 
  <main>
<div class="filters-row">
<div class="preset-row">
<button class="preset-btn active" data-preset="mtd">MTD</button>
<button class="preset-btn" data-preset="pm">PM</button>
<button class="preset-btn" data-preset="ytd">YTD</button>
<button class="preset-btn" data-preset="ltd">LTD</button>
</div>
<div class="filter-sep"></div>
<div class="filter-block"><label>Start month</label><select id="startMonth"></select></div>
<div class="filter-block"><label>End month</label><select id="endMonth"></select></div>
<div class="filter-sep"></div>
<div class="filter-block">
<label>Tier</label>
<select id="tierFilter">
<option value="all">All</option>
<option>Starter</option>
<option>Explorer</option>
<option>Insider</option>
<option>Elite</option>
<option>Ambassador</option>
</select>
</div>
<div class="filter-sep"></div>
<div class="filter-block">
<label>Product <span class="data-pending" title="Wizz cardholders are identified via a badge-progress proxy that undercounts real Wizz customers — see the Glossary">proxy</span></label>
<select id="productFilter">
<option value="all">All</option>
<option value="cardavantaj">Card Avantaj</option>
<option value="wizz">Wizz</option>
</select>
</div>
</div>
 
    <!-- ===================== TAB — EXECUTIVE SUMMARY ===================== -->
<section id="exec" class="tabpage active">
<div class="tab-eyebrow">Executive summary</div>
<div class="section-sub" style="margin:-4px 0 18px;">Is the program healthy, working, and profitable — one page, one read. Deep-dive financials live on Financial impact.</div>
 
      <div class="section-title">Key KPIs</div>
<div class="kpi-grid">
<div class="kpi-card neutral"><div class="label">Members in program</div><div class="value tabular" id="execKpiMembers">244,934</div><div class="foot">As of 28 Jul 2026</div></div>
<div class="kpi-card"><div class="label">Engaged members <span class="data-pending" title="Coin balance &gt; 0 shown as a placeholder; the engaged-member definition is not yet finalized — see the Glossary">definition pending</span></div><div class="value tabular" id="execKpiEngaged">150,209</div><div class="foot">As of 28 Jul 2026</div></div>
<div class="kpi-card warn"><div class="label">Program cost</div><div class="value tabular" id="execKpiCost">403K LEU</div><div class="foot">As of 28 Jul 2026</div></div>
<div class="kpi-card good"><div class="label">Redemption rate</div><div class="value tabular" id="execKpiRedRate">22%</div><div class="foot" id="execKpiRedRateFoot">MTD</div></div>
<div class="kpi-card"><div class="label">Coins collected</div><div class="value tabular" id="execKpiColl">1.83M</div><div class="foot" id="execKpiCollFoot">MTD</div></div>
<div class="kpi-card"><div class="label">Coins redeemed</div><div class="value tabular" id="execKpiRedeem">403K</div><div class="foot" id="execKpiRedeemFoot">MTD</div></div>
<div class="kpi-card warn"><div class="label">ROI — turnover ratio</div><div class="value tabular" id="execKpiRoi">16%</div><div class="foot" id="execKpiRoiFoot">MTD</div></div>
<div class="kpi-card pending"><div class="label">ROI — isolated uplift <span class="data-pending">not available</span></div><div class="value tabular">—</div><div class="foot">not period-driven</div></div>
</div>
 
      <div class="kpi-hero-row">
<div class="kpi-hero-card">
<div class="hero-label">Time to progress<br>Starter → Ambassador</div>
<div class="hero-value tabular">18 mo</div>
<div class="hero-foot">Full journey · life-to-date · does not respond to filters (monthly-grain data — reported in months, not weeks)</div>
</div>
</div>
 
      <div class="section-title">Program snapshot</div>
<div class="chart-card">
<h3>Members by tier</h3><div class="desc">Total members vs engaged members, selected period</div>
<div class="chart-wrap"><canvas id="chOvTiers"></canvas></div>
</div>
 
      <div class="section-title">Profitability evolution</div>
<div class="note-banner">Relative to the progression date (month 0), not enrollment — per the proposed <code>TIER_PROGRESSION_IMPACT</code> block. Aggregates across transitions from many calendar dates and is not segmented by product — it does <strong>not</strong> respond to the date, tier or product filters above. Self-selected cohort: an observed pattern, not proof of causation.</div>
<div class="selector-row">
<label>Transition</label>
<select id="progressionSelect">
<option value="0">Starter → Explorer</option>
<option value="1">Explorer → Insider</option>
<option value="2">Insider → Elite</option>
<option value="3">Elite → Ambassador</option>
</select>
<span class="desc" style="margin:0;">Avg. profit per member of the transitioning cohort, by month relative to the progression.</span>
</div>
<div class="chart-card full pending">
<div class="chart-wrap tall"><canvas id="chProgressionImpact"></canvas></div>
</div>
</section>
 
    <!-- ===================== TAB — FINANCIAL IMPACT ===================== -->
<section id="financial" class="tabpage">
<div class="tab-eyebrow">Financial impact</div>
<div class="section-sub" style="margin:-4px 0 18px;">Active vs. inactive members, overall and per tier — with the % difference driving the comparison.</div>
 
      <div class="section-title">Profitability: active vs. inactive — overall</div>
<div class="note-banner">"Active" = engaged (coin balance &gt; 0, definition pending — see Glossary). Members self-select into activity, so this is an <strong>observed difference</strong>, not proof the program caused it.</div>
<div class="chart-card full">
<table class="datatable">
<thead><tr><th>Segment</th><th class="num">Members</th><th class="num">Avg. profitability / user / month</th><th class="num">Avg. transactions / user / month</th></tr></thead>
<tbody id="activeVsInactiveOverallBody"></tbody>
</table>
</div>
 
      <div class="section-title">Per-tier financials: active vs. inactive <span class="data-pending">proposed, pending validation</span></div>
<div class="note-banner">From the proposed <code>TIER_FINANCIALS</code> block — drafted alongside this dashboard, not yet run against real data. Values shown are as of the selected end month. Ambassador has no inactive members in this preview, so its Δ% is not computable.</div>
<div class="chart-card full pending">
<table class="datatable">
<thead><tr>
<th>Tier</th>
<th class="num">Active members</th><th class="num">Inactive members</th>
<th class="num groupsep">Profit (active)</th><th class="num">Profit (inactive)</th><th class="num">Δ%</th>
<th class="num groupsep">Trx/mo (active)</th><th class="num">Trx/mo (inactive)</th><th class="num">Δ%</th>
</tr></thead>
<tbody id="tierFinancialsTableBody"></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
 
    <!-- ===================== TAB — COINS & REDEMPTION ===================== -->
<section id="coins" class="tabpage">
<div class="tab-eyebrow">Coins &amp; redemption</div>
 
      <div class="kpi-grid cols-3">
<div class="kpi-card"><div class="label">Coins earned</div><div class="value tabular" id="coKpiColl">2'456'789K RON</div><div class="foot" id="coKpiCollFoot">MTD</div></div>
<div class="kpi-card"><div class="label">Coins redeemed</div><div class="value tabular" id="coKpiRedeem">700K RON</div><div class="foot" id="coKpiRedeemFoot">MTD</div></div>
<div class="kpi-card good"><div class="label">Redemption rate</div><div class="value tabular" id="coKpiRedRate">29%</div><div class="foot" id="coKpiRedRateFoot">MTD</div></div>
</div>
 
      <div class="charts-grid" style="margin-top:22px;">
<div class="chart-card"><h3>Total coins collected (thousands RON)</h3><div class="desc">Stacked by tier, Starter → Ambassador</div><div class="chart-wrap tall"><canvas id="chCoinsCollected"></canvas></div></div>
<div class="chart-card"><h3>Total coins redeemed (thousands RON)</h3><div class="desc">Bars = total redeemed · line = redemption rate %</div><div class="chart-wrap tall"><canvas id="chCoinsRedeemed"></canvas></div></div>
</div>
<div class="charts-grid" style="margin-top:18px;">
<div class="chart-card"><h3>Average Avantaj coins collected per active member</h3><div class="desc">By tier, monthly evolution</div><div class="chart-wrap tall"><canvas id="chCoinsPerMember"></canvas></div></div>
<div class="chart-card"><h3>Monthly redemption value (RON) distribution per type</h3><div class="desc">Bonus conversion · Pay transactions · Vouchers &amp; experiences</div><div class="chart-wrap tall"><canvas id="chRedemptionByType"></canvas></div></div>
</div>
 
      <div class="note-banner flag">Flag: the source glossary previously warned against dropping the Reversal/Other redemption categories (it undercounts the true total). This page's category chart now shows only the 3 types in your reference screenshot — worth confirming with your manager whether Reversal/Other should still appear elsewhere, or are being tracked separately going forward.</div>
<div class="note-banner future">
<strong style="display:inline;font-size:inherit;">Discount coupons</strong> — future redemption channel, not yet live. <span class="data-pending">not available</span>
</div>
</section>
 
    <!-- ===================== TAB — CHALLENGES ===================== -->
<section id="challenges" class="tabpage">
<div class="tab-eyebrow">Challenges</div>
 
      <div class="kpi-grid cols-6">
